      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Or can you declare&nbsp;it after you've seen the Attack result?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A few other questions:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Does a basic Defend action defend against all attacks until the player's next turn, or just one attack?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If an Ability just says, \"until your next turn\" as opposed to \"until the start of your next turn\", does this mean it lasts until the end of your next turn?</p>",
