      "created_at": "2020-04-26T18:02:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>OK cool.</p>\n<p>By the way, does a basic Defend action defend against all attacks until the player's next turn, or just one attack?</p>\n<p>Also, if an Ability just says, \"until your next turn\" as opposed to \"until the start of your next turn\", does this mean it lasts until the end of your next turn?</p>",
