      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/4491bb/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2020-04-26T18:20:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>A Defend action lasts until it is used to block damage, or the start of it's creator's turn. Whichever comes first.</p>\n<p>I don't believe so, for the second question. The effect wears off at 'your next turn', so it would wear off the moment your next turn starts.&nbsp;</p>",
