      "created_at": "2020-04-27T08:12:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"catDreaming\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/4491bb/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> catDreaming:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>A Defend action lasts until it is used to block damage, or the start of it’s creator’s turn. Whichever comes first.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Am I right in assuming that if the hero gets attacked multiple times that they can choose any one of those attacks to Defend<br>\nagainst? As opposed to being restricted to defending against the first attack against them.</p>",
